# CVE: CVE-2026-47071
# Library: hackney (1.25.0)
# Severity: HIGH
# Title: Hackney ssl:connect/2 post-handshake upgrade timeout missing
# Status: Triaged / Accepted Risk
# Rationale: Pinned in mix.exs due to aws_encryption_sdk ~> 0.7 requirement.
#            Application code exclusively uses :req (Req / Finch / Mint) for external HTTP requests.
#            No untrusted TLS handshakes are processed through Hackney.
# Tracking: Pending aws_encryption_sdk release supporting hackney >= 4.0.1
# Review-By: 2026-12-31
CVE-2026-47071

